function systemView(s,expanded=false){if(!hasOrbitChart(s))return '';if(expanded&&planetFocus)return planetView(s);const layout=solarLayout(s),{orbits,moons,sites,stations,entities}=layout,planets=orbits.filter(b=>!b.synthetic),shown=stations.filter(b=>!expanded||stationFilters.has(b.category));
 const order=layout.total?`<div class="orbit-order"><div class="orbit-order-label"><span>PLANET ORBIT ORDER</span><span>INNER → OUTER</span></div><div class="orbit-order-slots">${orbits.map(b=>b.synthetic?`<span title="Orbit ${b.layoutSlot}: unnamed ${b.kind} planet (illustrative)">${b.layoutSlot}</span>`:`<button class="${selectedWorld===b.name?'selected':''}" data-world="${esc(b.name)}" aria-label="Inspect ${esc(b.name)}, ${b.confirmed?'orbital position':'schematic orbit'} ${b.layoutSlot}" title="${esc(b.name)} · ${b.confirmed?'documented orbit':'orbit unspecified; diagram ring'} ${b.layoutSlot}">${b.layoutSlot}${b.confirmed?'':'*'}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`:'';
 const pause=layout.total||s.silentPresence||s.centralBodyType==='black-hole'||EXOTIC_TYPES[s.centralBodyType]?`<button id="orbitToggle" class="orbit-toggle" aria-label="${orbitPaused?'Play':'Pause'} orbital animation" aria-pressed="${orbitPaused}">${orbitPaused?'▶ Play':'Ⅱ Pause'}</button>`:'';
 const filter=expanded?`<div class="station-filters" aria-label="Visible station categories">${Object.entries(STATION_TYPES).filter(([name])=>name!=='TORA').map(([name,t],i)=>{const count=stations.filter(b=>b.category===name).length;return `<button id="stationFilter${i}" data-station-filter="${name}" aria-pressed="${stationFilters.has(name)}" ${count?'':'disabled'} style="--station-color:${t.color}"><span aria-hidden="true">${t.symbol}</span> ${name} <b>${count}</b></button>`}).join('')}<button id="showAllStations">Show all</button></div>`:'';
 const named=planets.length?`<div class="orbit-labels">${planets.flatMap(b=>[bodyKey(b),...moons.filter(m=>m.parent===b.name).map(bodyKey)]).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="orbit-empty">${s.kind==='uncertain'?'Stellar configuration unresolved.':'No major worlds named in this record.'}</div>`;
 return `<section class="system-view ${expanded?'expanded-system':''}" aria-label="${esc(s.name)} solar system">
 <div class="system-view-head">${expanded?`<div class="focus-title"><button id="backToRegion" class="back-region">← Return to ${s.unplottedSystem?'chart':'region'}</button><div class="eyebrow">SYSTEM EXPLORER</div><h2>${systemLink(s)}</h2>${tierMarkup(s)}${cloakBadge(s)}<p>${s.unplottedSystem?'1 catalogued planet · coordinates classified':orbits.length+' planetary orbits'}${entities.length?' · '+entities.length+' Silent macroform':''} · ${moons.length} major moon${moons.length===1?'':'s'} · ${stations.length} station${stations.length===1?'':'s'}${s.id==='calidor'?' · Foundry off scale':''}</p></div>`:`<span class="eyebrow">${esc(s.name)+' · system view'}</span>`}<div class="system-actions">${pause}${expanded?'<button id="beltToggle" class="orbit-toggle" '+(s.beltSlot?'':'disabled title="No belt shown in this system"')+' aria-pressed="'+Boolean(s.beltSlot&&showBelts)+'">Belts</button><button id="systemZoomIn" class="orbit-toggle system-zoom" aria-label="Zoom in system diagram">+</button><button id="systemZoomOut" class="orbit-toggle system-zoom" aria-label="Zoom out system diagram">−</button><button id="focusFullscreen" class="orbit-toggle" aria-label="Toggle fullscreen">⛶</button>':''}</div></div>
 ${!expanded?'<button id="focusSystem" class="focus-system">⛶ &nbsp; Focus system <span>Expand into main chart →</span></button>':''}${filter}${expanded?'<p class="focus-hint">Select a symbol to inspect it. Double-click a planet to explore its orbit. Names open the Codex.</p>':''}
 ${s.silentPresence?'<p class="silent-status" role="status">Silent activity detected · signal interference</p>':''}<div class="focus-visual">${cloakDecoration(s)}${silentDecoration(s)}<svg id="orbitDiagram" class="orbit-diagram" viewBox="${expanded?'0 0 760 580':'0 0 320 258'}" role="group" aria-label="Schematic system view of ${esc(s.name)}; select a star, world or station symbol to inspect it"></svg>${expanded&&stationRecords(s).some(b=>b.name==='Foundry')?foundryCorner():''}</div>
 <div class="stellar-register" aria-label="Codex articles">${starRecords(s).map(star=>link(star.name,(star.tag==='Black hole'?'◉  Go to Black Hole':'✦  Go to Star')+(s.primaries?.length>1?' · '+star.name:''),'stellar-action')).join('')}${link(systemArticleTitle(s),'◎  Go to System','stellar-action')}</div>${expanded?notableSitesMarkup(s):''}<div class="system-center"><button id="inspectSystem" class="orbit-toggle" aria-label="Inspect ${esc(s.name)} system dossier">System dossier</button></div>${order}
 ${entities.length?`<div class="orbit-site-heading">SILENT MACROFORMS</div><div class="orbit-labels">${entities.map(bodyKey).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="system-catalog"><div><div class="orbit-site-heading">MAJOR WORLDS & MOONS</div>${named}${sites.length?`<div class="orbit-site-heading">ASSOCIATED SITES · ORBIT UNSPECIFIED</div><div class="orbit-labels">${sites.map(bodyKey).join('')}</div>`:''}</div><div><div class="orbit-site-heading">STATIONS <span>${shown.length} / ${stations.length}</span></div><div class="orbit-labels">${shown.map(bodyKey).join('')||'<p class="orbit-empty">'+(stations.length?'All station categories are hidden.':'No stations catalogued here.')+'</p>'}</div></div></div>
 ${layout.total?'<div class="orbit-sample-key"><span>Named world</span><span>Unnamed planet</span><span>Station symbols: S1, S2…</span></div>':''}<p class="orbit-caption">${s.sparseOrbits?'Every charted planet has a local satellite view.':'Dim planets and asteroid belts illustrate gaps in the catalogue.'} Sizes, distances, inclinations and speeds are schematic. ${planets.some(b=>DATA.worlds[b.name]?.extendedSatelliteChart)?'Focus the planet to explore its stations and natural satellites.':'Station symbols match the register below.'}${planets.some(b=>!b.confirmed)?' * Named world’s orbital position is unspecified.':''} Sites with unknown host orbits appear in a separate row.</p></section>`;
}
